        "content": "## Retrieval / Indexing / Graph\nPair with the Retrieval and Indexing workbench tabs. Traffic and latency panels are deployment-wide (no corpus label); the index-size bars are per corpus. Stage-level detail is on **TriBridRAG Metrics**.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Operator Notes",
      "type": "text"
    }
  ],
